    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "left",
        "type": "jump",
        "power": 30,
        "times": 3,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "It's Kroos, my benefactor! Dear me, here, good benefactor, come, if you had a free hand, you could've helped me a little sooner! Er, where, where are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Right here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$path_intro",
        "key": "$path_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_142#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yah...! M\u2014Miss, where did you come from?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Little Girl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_142#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wow! I'd be remiss not to laud your sniping skills as beyond the blue! You slip about like a ghost, land without a whisper! You really are\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_142#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss! Thank you for saving mister!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Little Girl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_142#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Err.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Run on back, quick. Your mum's been looking for you for ages now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_142#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm-hm!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Little Girl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "exit",
        "direction": "right",
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Benefactor, why don't you hurry to Lava and Saga's aid? Let me keep watch here, safeguard the perimeter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't you just cross your heart you'd return to Lava to help her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "B\u2014Benefactor, might you have the gift of clairaudience...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Nope.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why've you been holding onto that folding fan the whole time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, I simply must! This fan is the most precious thing I have, a present to me from my most respected teacher! I'd hate to let it out of my grasp!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "text": "Moreover, here, clasping this fan in my hand, I look quite refined, don't I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#3",
        "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmmmgh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why'd that Ink Spirit get over here just now without any trouble? It counts as daytime, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#3",
        "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I was wondering too! That cretin chased the wind out of me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm... anyhow, better head for Lava.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#6"
    },
