    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_362_Saga",
        "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's quiet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're clearly on the fringe of night here. I can only see a crack of dawnlight. Why aren't any monsters charging through?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_362_Saga",
        "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I also thought it strange. It has never been so peaceful, has it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saga"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_139#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't it good that it's peaceful?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dawn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_362_Saga"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha! That is so. I may at last catch my breath!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saga"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "jump",
        "power": 10,
        "ypos": -20,
        "times": 2,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "text": "Huff!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saga"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_139#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Careful you don't crush any goods.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dawn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_362_Saga",
        "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Saga, the Dusk Beauty you mentioned just now... who does that refer to?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_362_Saga",
        "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Naturally, the Dusk Beauty of the well-told 'Dusk Beauty Flying to the Moon' tale. My word, to this day I cannot forget the sight of the eyes of Dusk Beauty\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saga"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_362_Saga",
        "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...???",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_139#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Saga, tell it a little slower. Miss Lava's giving you a funnier and funnier look.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dawn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_362_Saga"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, beg pardon, 'twas my impatience. Lava, thou art also tired from withstanding Ink Spirits, art thou not? Ought we perhaps sit down with some tea, and there make proper talk?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saga"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_139#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure. I'll go brew you some tea, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dawn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_139#5",
        "name2": "char_362_Saga",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, I would like to ask thee first. Young Dawn, dost thou know any way of leaving this place?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saga"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_139#5",
        "name2": "char_362_Saga",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dawn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_139#5",
        "name2": "char_362_Saga",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Thou dost not?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saga"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_139#1",
        "name2": "char_362_Saga",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Lightly shakes head)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dawn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_139#5",
        "name2": "char_362_Saga"
    },
